1
00:01:22,105 --> 00:01:28,105
Grinches Are Scary, Or So Everyone Hears, But One
Little Boy Overcomes His Worst Fears!

2
00:02:44,210 --> 00:02:50,210
Halloween Is Grinch Night is a fantasy, family,
animation film directed by Gerard Baldwin.

3
00:04:06,315 --> 00:04:12,315
When the sour-sweet wind starts blowing again, the Whos retreat to their
homes because they know the Grinch will soon be a'prowlin.

4
00:05:28,421 --> 00:05:34,421
Young Eukariah Who has to make a trip to the Euphemism (outhouse), when the
wind blows him away to a confrontation with the gruesome Grinch.

5
00:06:50,526 --> 00:06:56,526
Eukariah decides that the Grinch must be stopped, so he faces his
fears and confronts the Grinch and his spooks.

6
00:08:12,631 --> 00:08:18,631
The Grinch / Narrator (voice), played by Hans Conried.

7
00:09:34,736 --> 00:09:40,736
Josiah (voice), played by Hal Smith.

8
00:10:56,842 --> 00:11:02,842
Euchariah (voice), played by Gary Shapiro.

9
00:12:18,947 --> 00:12:24,947
Mariah (voice), played by Irene Tedrow.

10
00:13:41,052 --> 00:13:47,052
Sgt. Samuel McPherson (voice), played by Jack DeLeon.

11
00:15:03,157 --> 00:15:09,157
Max (voice), played by Henry Gibson.

12
00:16:25,263 --> 00:16:31,263
Halloween Is Grinch Night (titled It's Grinch Night for the 1992 videocassette release and Grinch Night for the sing-a-long videocassette release) is a
1977 children's animated Halloween television special and is a prequel to the 1966 television special How the Grinch Stole Christmas!

13
00:17:47,368 --> 00:17:53,368
It premiered on ABC on October 28, 1977.

14
00:19:09,473 --> 00:19:15,473
Boris Karloff, the original voice actor for The Grinch, had died and was replaced by Hans
Conried, with Thurl Ravenscroft singing as he did in the original special.

15
00:20:31,578 --> 00:20:37,578
The songs and score were written by Sesame Street composer Joe Raposo.

16
00:21:53,684 --> 00:21:59,684
The special won the 1978 Primetime Emmy Award for
Outstanding Children's Program.

17
00:23:15,789 --> 00:23:21,789
The film explores themes of holiday, halloween, musical,
based on children's book, short film.

18
00:24:37,894 --> 00:24:43,894
The tone is lighthearted.
